{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ServeText.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ScanningMoviesGIF.gif?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assist customers by scanning movies, taking payments, and managing returns, to grow your retro video rental store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/StockText.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/PlacingMoviesGIF.gif?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose which movies to sell, and place them within your store. As you progress you can unlock consoles, video players, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/TidyText.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/SweepingLeavesGIF.gif?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep on top of it! Scrub graffiti, pick up trash, and sweep leaves to keep your store looking tidy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ExpandText.png?t=1740794734\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/Screenshot_2024-12-03_150449.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your store, unlock more products, hire employees, attract more customers and boost your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/DecorateText.png?t=1740794734\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/Screenshot_2024-12-03_150812.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a range of customization options and change the look and feel of your store. Find what suits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase movies, consoles, video players, and snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rent them to customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Process returns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handle cash and card payments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Upgrade Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217050/fc61faa50b4651756e923f04263666210edfbe11.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217050/caff77f198272483fe4847803ec14f27aabad9b9.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217050/18e085ea8d03953ce2791c19e7112b42aa603471.jpg"},{"name":"Max upgrades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217050/b520fc35b31fe342252f87e4f27b7e567209390c.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3217050?t=1740794734","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/stor