em_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/SweepingLeavesGIF.gif?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep on top of it! Scrub graffiti, pick up trash, and sweep leaves to keep your store looking tidy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ExpandText.png?t=1740794734\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/Screenshot_2024-12-03_150449.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your store, unlock more products, hire employees, attract more customers and boost your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/DecorateText.png?t=1740794734\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/Screenshot_2024-12-03_150812.png?t=1740794734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a range of customization options and change the look and feel of your store. Find what suits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase movies, consoles, video players, and snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rent them to customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Process returns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handle cash and card payments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate</p></li></ul>","developers":["Valance Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akama